  "content": "<div class=\"p-10 font-serif max-w-lg mx-auto bg-[#0a050d] text-rose-50 rounded-3xl border border-rose-500/20 relative shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(236,72,153,0.1)] m-4\">\n  <div class=\"absolute inset-2 border border-rose-500/5 rounded-2xl pointer-events-none\"></div>\n  <div class=\"text-center space-y-6 relative z-10\">\n    <div class=\"text-4xl\">👑💖🔮</div>\n    <span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono hover:text-rose-400 text-rose-500 tracking-[0.25em] uppercase\">My Sweet 15 Celebration</span>\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-extralight uppercase text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-300 via-purple-200 to-rose-400 bg-clip-text\">\n       FESTA DE 15 ANOS\n    </h1>\n    \n    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed font-sans max-w-xs mx-auto\">\n      Um capítulo de sonhos está para começar! A debutante <strong class=\"text-rose-400\">{{nome_debutante}}</strong> convida você para celebrar esta noite inesquecível de magia, valsa e alta gastronomia!\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 divide-x divide-zinc-800 border-y border-zinc-800 py-4 my-2 text-center font-sans text-xs\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-rose-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">DATA DOURADA</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-rose-200\">{{data_debutante}}</strong>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-rose-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">GRANDE ENTRADA</span>\n        <strong class=\"text-rose-200\">{{hora_debutante}} h</strong>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bg-zinc-950 p-4 rounded-xl border border-rose-500/10 font-sans text-xs\">\n      <span class=\"block text-[8px] font-mono text-rose-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\">Nosso Salão Real</span>\n      <p class=\"text-zinc-300 font-medium font-sans\">{{local_salao_festa}}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-rose-400 italic font-sans font-medium\">\n      Tema Oficial do Sonho: <strong class=\"text-white\">{{tema_festa}}</strong>\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"pt-4 text-center font-sans\">\n      <p class=\"text-[9px] text-zinc-500 uppercase font-mono mb-2\">Por favor, envie o seu RSVP para a assessora real</p>\n      <a href=\"https://wa.me/{{whats_confirmar}}\" class=\"inline-block bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-600 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest py-2 px-6 rounded-full transition shadow-lg\">\n        Confirmar Presença no WhatsApp\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
